      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FARMOR BACARDI (4) jumped from a low draw and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten half a length (21.62) behind KASEY'S WAY at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with nine wins and five minor placings from 16 starts. Makes plenty of appeal. PIKA WAVE (1) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at this track over 380m behind HOLLY MAGIC (22.26) in a Grade 1/2. Has ability and can atone. VILLAIN OF FIRE (8) scored by a space when a 8 length winner at this track over 380m in the best time of the card (21.57). The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Can measure up again. MAD BUNCH (2) has been in the frame at his last two runs, most recently when second (22.13) in a Grade 3/4 over 380m at this track.",
